# Next.js Platform Admin App (apps/admin)

Patron Loyalty platform-operator dashboard at **loyalty-admin.sysplat.com**.
Stack: Next.js 15 (App Router), React 19, Tailwind CSS, Radix UI.

## Guidelines
- **Audience:** Platform operators and support staff for **Patron Loyalty only** — not QMS queue tenants and not loyalty staff end-users.
- **Separate from QMS:** Do not point this app at QPlatform API; use `loyalty-api.sysplat.com`. QMS admin stays on `qplatform-admin.sysplat.com`.
- **Component Creation:** Use functional components with Tailwind CSS. Place reusable UI components in `src/components/ui/`.
- **Architecture Boundary:** NEVER import from `apps/loyalty`. Call `packages/api` `platform-admin/*` routes only.
- **Security:** Administrative actions must remain auditable via `PlatformAuditEvent` / Auth Audit Trail.
